"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">27</div><h1>시간의 종속절</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Temporale Nebensätze</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 27의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>B1 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 9 · 도전 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">과거의 한 번은 als, 되풀이와 현재·미래는 wenn으로 구별해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">während·bevor·nachdem·seit·bis·sobald·solange를 뜻에 맞게 써요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">nachdem과 seit 문장의 시제를 맞춰요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">전치사·접속사·접속부사와 wann·wenn·als를 구별해요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> ich zum ersten Mal in Wien war, habe ich mich sofort in die Stadt verliebt.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Wann</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Wenn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Als</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ob</button></div><div class=\"qe\">과거에 한 번 있었던 일(처음 빈에 간 일)이라서 als예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> meine Großeltern uns besuchen, backt meine Oma immer Apfelkuchen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ob</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Als</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Wenn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Wann</button></div><div class=\"qe\">현재에 되풀이되는 일(immer)이라서 wenn이에요.<br>als는 과거의 한 번에만 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Während&quot;,&quot;Solange&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(~하는 동안)</span> wir in Italien Urlaub machten, hat es kein einziges Mal geregnet.</div><div class=\"qko\">이탈리아에서 휴가를 보내는 동안 비가 한 번도 오지 않았어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Während</b> wir in Italien Urlaub machten, hat es kein einziges Mal geregnet.</div>휴가 기간과 같은 때에 일어난 일이라서 während예요.<br>'그동안 내내'라는 뜻으로 solange도 돼요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;bevor&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Meine Mutter trinkt immer eine Tasse Tee, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(~하기 전에)</span> sie aus dem Haus geht.</div><div class=\"qko\">엄마는 집을 나서기 전에 늘 차를 한 잔 마셔요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Meine Mutter trinkt immer eine Tasse Tee, <b>bevor</b> sie aus dem Haus geht.</div>차를 마시는 일이 먼저, 집을 나서는 일이 나중이에요 → bevor.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Seit&quot;,&quot;Seitdem&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(~한 이후로 (지금도))</span> mein Bruder einen Hund hat, geht er zweimal am Tag spazieren.</div><div class=\"qko\">형은 개를 키운 뒤로 하루에 두 번 산책해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Seit</b> mein Bruder einen Hund hat, geht er zweimal am Tag spazieren.</div>지금도 이어지는 일의 시작점은 seit(dem)이에요. 두 문장 모두 현재형이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;bis&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Bleib bitte im Auto, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(~할 때까지)</span> ich zurück bin.</div><div class=\"qko\">내가 돌아올 때까지 차에 있어.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Bleib bitte im Auto, <b>bis</b> ich zurück bin.</div>어떤 일이 일어날 때까지 계속되면 bis예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> der Unterricht vorbei ist, packen die Schüler ihre Taschen. (수업이 끝나자마자)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Bevor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Solange</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Seit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Sobald</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'~하자마자'는 sobald예요. solange는 '~하는 동안 내내'예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> du hohes Fieber hast, darfst du nicht zur Schule gehen. (열이 나는 동안 내내)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Sobald</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Nachdem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Bis</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Solange</button></div><div class=\"qe\">어떤 상태가 계속되는 동안 내내는 solange예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;gebacken&quot;],[&quot;hatte&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Nachdem sie den Kuchen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(backen)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben 또는 sein)</span>, stellte sie ihn auf den Balkon.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀는 케이크를 구운 뒤 발코니에 내놓았어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Nachdem sie den Kuchen <b>gebacken</b> <b>hatte</b>, stellte sie ihn auf den Balkon.</div>주문장이 과거형(stellte)이라서 nachdem 절은 과거완료예요 — gebacken hatte.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;gesehen&quot;],[&quot;habe&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Nachdem ich die Nachrichten <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(sehen)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben 또는 sein)</span>, räume ich noch die Küche auf.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 뉴스를 보고 나서 부엌을 정리해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Nachdem ich die Nachrichten <b>gesehen</b> <b>habe</b>, räume ich noch die Küche auf.</div>주문장이 현재형이면 nachdem 절은 현재완료예요 — gesehen habe.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> dem Konzert haben wir noch etwas getrunken. (콘서트가 끝난 뒤에)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Danach</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Nachdem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Bevor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Nach</button></div><div class=\"qe\">명사(dem Konzert) 앞에는 전치사 nach를 써요.<br>nachdem은 문장 앞, danach는 혼자 첫 자리에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Wir haben zuerst eingekauft. <span class=\"qblank\"></span> sind wir ins Kino gegangen. (그다음에)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Nach</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Danach</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Bevor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Nachdem</button></div><div class=\"qe\">앞 문장을 받는 접속부사 danach가 첫 자리에 오고 바로 동사가 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Während&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(~ 동안 · Fahrt · 여성)</span> der Fahrt hat das Kind die ganze Zeit geschlafen.</div><div class=\"qko\">가는 동안 아이는 내내 잤어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Während</b> der Fahrt hat das Kind die ganze Zeit geschlafen.</div>명사 앞이라서 전치사 während예요. während 뒤는 2격이에요 — der Fahrt.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> Kannst du mir sagen, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> die Apotheke heute schließt?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) als</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) seit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) wenn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) wann</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'언제'를 묻는 간접의문문은 wann이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;wenn&quot;,&quot;sobald&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> Ruf mich bitte an, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> dein Zug in Köln ankommt.</div><div class=\"qko\">기차가 쾰른에 도착하면 전화해 줘.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ruf mich bitte an, <b>wenn</b> dein Zug in Köln ankommt.</div>앞으로의 일은 wenn이에요. '도착하자마자'라는 뜻으로 sobald도 돼요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Bevor wir losfahren müssen wir noch tanken&quot;,&quot;Wir müssen noch tanken bevor wir losfahren&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">출발하기 전에 기름을 넣어야 해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Bevor</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">losfahren</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">noch</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">tanken</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">müssen</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Bevor wir losfahren, müssen wir noch tanken.</b></div>bevor 절은 동사가 맨 끝(losfahren)이에요.<br>bevor 절이 앞이면 주문장은 동사 müssen부터, 원형 tanken은 끝이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Als&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(~했을 때)</span> meine Eltern noch in Daegu wohnten, besuchten wir sie jedes Wochenende.</div><div class=\"qko\">부모님이 아직 대구에 사셨을 때 우리는 주말마다 찾아갔어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Als</b> meine Eltern noch in Daegu wohnten, besuchten wir sie jedes Wochenende.</div>방문은 되풀이됐지만 '대구에 사신 때'는 과거의 한 시기예요. 그래서 als예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> Jedes Mal, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> ich bei ihr anrief, war die Leitung besetzt.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) als</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) ob</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) wenn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) wann</button></div><div class=\"qe\">과거에 되풀이된 일은 als가 아니라 wenn이에요 — jedes Mal, wenn …</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;mache&quot;],[&quot;habe&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Seit ich jeden Morgen Yoga <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(machen)</span>, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben)</span> ich weniger Rückenschmerzen.</div><div class=\"qko\">매일 아침 요가를 한 뒤로 허리 통증이 줄었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Seit ich jeden Morgen Yoga <b>mache</b>, <b>habe</b> ich weniger Rückenschmerzen.</div>seit 절의 일이 지금도 이어지면 두 문장 모두 현재형이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> '일이 끝나자마자 너한테 갈게.'</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Sobald ich bin mit der Arbeit fertig, komme ich zu dir.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Sobald mit der Arbeit ich fertig bin, komme ich zu dir.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Sobald ich mit der Arbeit fertig bin, komme ich zu dir.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Sobald ich mit der Arbeit fertig bin, ich komme zu dir.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sobald 절은 동사가 맨 끝이고, 주문장은 동사부터 시작해요 — bin, komme.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Während die Kinder schliefen schmückten wir den Weihnachtsbaum&quot;,&quot;Wir schmückten den Weihnachtsbaum während die Kinder schliefen&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">아이들이 자는 동안 우리는 크리스마스트리를 꾸몄어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Weihnachtsbaum</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">schmückten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">schliefen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Während</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Kinder</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">den</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Während die Kinder schliefen, schmückten wir den Weihnachtsbaum.</b></div>während 절은 동사 schliefen이 끝이에요.<br>앞에 오면 주문장은 동사 schmückten부터 시작해요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Bevor&quot;],[&quot;abreise&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Vor der Abreise gieße ich die Blumen.<br>= <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> ich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(abreisen)</span>, gieße ich die Blumen.</div><div class=\"qko\">떠나기 전에 꽃에 물을 줘요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Vor der Abreise gieße ich die Blumen.<br>= <b>Bevor</b> ich <b>abreise</b>, gieße ich die Blumen.</div>명사 앞의 vor를 문장으로 바꾸면 접속사 bevor예요.<br>동사가 끝으로 가면 분리동사가 붙어요 — abreise.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> Er hat sich bei mir entschuldigt. <span class=\"qblank\"></span> verstehen wir uns wieder gut. (그 뒤로 지금까지)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Seit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Seitdem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Nachdem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Bevor</button></div><div class=\"qe\">앞 문장을 받아 '그 뒤로 지금까지'는 접속부사 seitdem이에요. 바로 뒤에 동사가 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;wann&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> Ich weiß nicht mehr genau, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> wir uns zum ersten Mal getroffen haben – war es 2019 oder 2020?</div><div class=\"qko\">우리가 언제 처음 만났는지 정확히 기억이 안 나요. 2019년이었나, 2020년이었나?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich weiß nicht mehr genau, <b>wann</b> wir uns zum ersten Mal getroffen haben – war es 2019 oder 2020?</div>때를 묻는 간접의문문이라서 wann이에요. als·wenn은 '~했을 때·~하면'이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Seit er nicht mehr raucht kann er viel besser schlafen&quot;,&quot;Er kann viel besser schlafen seit er nicht mehr raucht&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그는 담배를 끊은 뒤로 훨씬 잘 자요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Seit</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">kann</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">raucht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">mehr</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">schlafen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">besser</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">er</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">viel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">er</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Seit er nicht mehr raucht, kann er viel besser schlafen.</b></div>seit 절은 동사 raucht가 끝, 두 문장 모두 현재형이에요.<br>주문장은 kann이 먼저, 원형 schlafen이 끝이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Als&quot;],[&quot;Bis&quot;],[&quot;wenn&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> ich letztes Jahr nach Berlin kam, kannte ich niemanden. <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(~할 때까지)</span> ich eine Wohnung fand, wohnte ich bei einer Kollegin. Und <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"> ich heute an diese Zeit denke, muss ich lachen.</div><div class=\"qko\">작년에 베를린에 왔을 때 나는 아무도 몰랐어요. 집을 구할 때까지 동료 집에서 지냈어요. 그리고 지금 그때를 생각하면 웃음이 나요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Als</b> ich letztes Jahr nach Berlin kam, kannte ich niemanden. <b>Bis</b> ich eine Wohnung fand, wohnte ich bei einer Kollegin. Und <b>wenn</b> ich heute an diese Zeit denke, muss ich lachen.</div>과거의 한 번 → als, 집을 구할 때까지 → bis, 지금의 때 → wenn이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Seit sie die neue Stelle hat, schläft sie besser.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Wenn ich früher krank war, kochte meine Mutter mir Suppe.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Als wir 2018 in Japan waren, haben wir viel Sushi gegessen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Nachdem wir die Wohnung renoviert haben, zogen wir ein.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">주문장이 과거형(zogen)이면 nachdem 절은 과거완료예요 — renoviert hatten.<br>früher의 되풀이는 wenn이 맞아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Während&quot;],[&quot;meines&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Während ich studierte, jobbte ich in einem Café.<br>= <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(전치사)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(mein · 2격)</span> Studiums jobbte ich in einem Café.</div><div class=\"qko\">대학 다니는 동안 카페에서 아르바이트를 했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Während ich studierte, jobbte ich in einem Café.<br>= <b>Während</b> <b>meines</b> Studiums jobbte ich in einem Café.</div>문장을 명사로 바꾸면 전치사 während + 2격이에요.<br>das Studium의 2격 → meines Studiums.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> 빈칸에 들어갈 수 <strong>없는</strong> 것은?<br><span class=\"qblank\"></span> ich die Präsentation hielt, war ich sehr nervös.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Als</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Während</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Bevor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Nachdem</button></div><div class=\"qe\">nachdem 절은 주문장보다 한 단계 앞선 시제여야 해요 — gehalten hatte.<br>als·während·bevor는 같은 시제를 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Nachdem er das Formular ausgefüllt hatte musste er noch zwei Stunden warten&quot;,&quot;Er musste noch zwei Stunden warten nachdem er das Formular ausgefüllt hatte&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그는 서류를 다 작성한 뒤에도 두 시간을 더 기다려야 했어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">musste</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">er</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">hatte</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">er</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">noch</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Formular</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Stunden</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">Nachdem</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">ausgefüllt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"10\">warten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"11\">zwei</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Nachdem er das Formular ausgefüllt hatte, musste er noch zwei Stunden warten.</b></div>nachdem 절은 과거완료 ausgefüllt hatte가 끝이에요.<br>주문장은 musste부터, 원형 warten이 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Wann&quot;],[&quot;Wenn&quot;],[&quot;als&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">31.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> hast du Zeit? – <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> ich morgen früher Feierabend habe, rufe ich dich an. Letzte Woche, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"> du angerufen hast, war ich leider beim Sport.</div><div class=\"qko\">언제 시간 있어? – 내일 일찍 퇴근하면 전화할게. 지난주에 네가 전화했을 때는 아쉽게도 운동 중이었어.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wann</b> hast du Zeit? – <b>Wenn</b> ich morgen früher Feierabend habe, rufe ich dich an. Letzte Woche, <b>als</b> du angerufen hast, war ich leider beim Sport.</div>질문 '언제'는 wann, 미래의 조건·때는 wenn, 과거의 한 번은 als예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"31\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 31</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"